      "section": "time.clock",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "Gambian Mandinka 'talaŋ {h}' (talaŋ = o'clock/bell), additive 'aniŋ miniti N' and 'aniŋ talantee' (and a half) at 30; Mandinka numerals luulu 5, taŋ 10, muwaŋ 20, taŋ saba 30, taŋ naani 40, taŋ luulu 50. No subtractive form used. Normalised hours[0]/[11] to 'taŋ niŋ fula' / 'taŋ niŋ kiliŋ' (file had mixed 'tan ning'/'taŋ ning'). Orthography in this file mixes Gambian (ŋ) and ɔ-based spellings; I followed what was there."
